Derivative Work Attribution:
This model is a fine-tuned derivative work based on Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B,
originally developed by the Qwen Team, Alibaba Cloud, and distributed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B).

Summary of Modifications:
- Fine-tuned via LoRA (r=16, alpha=32) for structured fact extraction and
  pre-write fact verification / revision in local memory pipelines.
- Exported merged GGUF quantizations (Q8_0 and Q4_K_M) and Ollama Modelfiles.

Schema Lineage & Ecosystem Compatibility:
The prompt/output JSON schema conventions used by this model (including bank
partitioning, fact types "world" / "experience" / "observation", temporal
fields occurred_start / occurred_end / mentioned_at, and where / entities
metadata) are inspired by and conceptually compatible with Vectorize Hindsight
(https://github.com/vectorize-io/hindsight, MIT License), and also serve as the
companion specialist model for ZeroMem (https://github.com/IMLIULIAN/zeromem).
No Vectorize Hindsight source code is included in this repository.

